WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
Every straight line hides two numbers. Which?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.540
c is where the line crosses the y axis. Here, 1.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.880
m is the slope: go 1 right, and it rises 2.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.760
Make m bigger, and it gets steeper.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.013
Change c, and the whole line slides up.
